# TESS Exoplanet Pipeline — optional environment variables
# Copy relevant lines to ~/.bashrc, /etc/environment, or a .env loader.

# ─── GPU BLS acceleration (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave GPU_BLS_URL unset (default) for CPU-only mode — no code changes needed.
# Set it to the address of a running gpu_bls_service.py instance to enable GPU BLS.
#
# Example (service on the same host):
# GPU_BLS_URL=http://localhost:9876
#
# Example (service on a remote GPU machine):
# GPU_BLS_URL=http://192.168.1.164:9876

# ─── gpu_bls_service.py settings (on the GPU host) ──────────────────────────
# BLS_GPU_DEVICE=0     # which GPU to use (0 = first, 1 = second, etc.)
# BLS_PORT=9876        # HTTP port to listen on
# BLS_HOST=0.0.0.0     # bind address
